{"id":"tanto","lemma":"tanto","pos":"noun","rank":173,"glosses":["copy","poker chip; counter","point; goal (in a game)"],"ipa":"/ˈtanto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tantos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-tanto.wav","formAudio":{"tantos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-tantos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Cómo hiciste tanto en tan poco tiempo?","en":"How did you do so much in so little time?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850397","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"little, not much"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"¿He cambiado tanto?","en":"Have I changed that much?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/513182","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"changed"},null]},{"text":"Hoy puedes comer tanto como quieras.","en":"Today you can eat as much as you want.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518227","words":[{"g":"today, tonight"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to eat"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"as you like"]]},{"text":"Nunca había visto tanto dinero.","en":"I'd never seen so much money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582336","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"seen"},null,{"g":"money"}]},{"text":"No puedo pagar tanto.","en":"I can't pay that much.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567658","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to pay"},null]}]}